hash = img_phash(blob)
if last_err() then return end
debug(hash)
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.SS img_nudity
.sp
Classify an image for nudity. The score goes from 0 to 2. A score above 1 means
nudity has been detected.
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
nudity = img_nudity(blob)
if last_err() then return end
debug(nudity)
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
